.TH openalex-snapshot-enrich 1
.SH NAME
openalex-snapshot-enrich \- add abstract + citation columns to works parquet
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B openalex-snapshot enrich
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads raw works from <root>/parquet/works_aws/ and writes an enriched copy to
<root>/parquet/works/ that adds two columns: abstract (reconstructed from the JSON
abstract_inverted_index) and citation. Incremental and row-parity checked; the raw
works_aws/ is left untouched. Run automatically by `download` unless --no-enrich.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --overwrite
Rebuild enriched files instead of skipping up-to-date ones.
.SH EXAMPLE
openalex-snapshot enrich --root-dir /data
.SH SEE ALSO
openalex-snapshot-download(1), openalex-snapshot-index(1), openalex-snapshot-extract(1)
